&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Onsite Manager (Bilingual)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Schedule: 3rd Shift / M-F 10:30 PM–6:30 AM&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;At Openwork, our Onsite Managers are responsible for keeping staffing operations running smoothly at one of our larger client accounts. You’ll work directly with the client and our employees, manage day-to-day onsite needs, and make sure we’re delivering on our commitments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;This is a hands-on role for someone who is organized, dependable, comfortable working with people, and able to handle a fast-paced environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage day-to-day staffing operations at a large client account, including employee check-in, attendance, reporting, and general onsite support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the primary recruiter for the account, working with the local branch when additional recruiting support is needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong relationships with both client contacts and employees working onsite&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handle employee questions, concerns, and day-to-day issues and work to resolve them quickly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee the hiring and onboarding process to ensure company and client requirements are met&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Complete weekly compliance checks, including background checks, drug screens, I-9s, and E-Verify&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate employee and account information in our systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track performance and staffing KPIs to make sure goals and client expectations are being met&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gather employee referrals and help maintain a strong talent pipeline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to grow the account and increase our staffing presence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in client meetings and quarterly business reviews and help communicate account results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the branch team and attend branch huddles, including at least one in-person huddle each week&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with hiring and training internal team members supporting the account&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with onsite financial goals and collections as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide a weekly summary of account activity, staffing, and performance to your manager&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bilingual in &lt;strong&gt;English and Spanish&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working onsite and on an overnight schedule&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and customer service skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organized and able to manage multiple priorities at once&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dependable and comfortable working independently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem-solving skills and the ability to stay calm when things get busy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working directly with both clients and employees&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous staffing, recruiting, operations, customer service, or people-management experience is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Openwork?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;At Openwork, we believe staffing should be personal. We work hard to make a difference for the people we employ, the clients we support, and the communities we serve.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;With more than 50 years of staffing experience, we’re a growing, people-first company that values teamwork, accountability, and doing the right thing. We’ve been recognized as a &lt;strong&gt;ClearlyRated Best of Staffing®&lt;/strong&gt; winner, one of &lt;strong&gt;SIA’s Fastest Growing Staffing Companies&lt;/strong&gt;, and a &lt;strong&gt;2025 Best Staffing Firm to Work For&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re looking for a hands-on role where you can build relationships, solve problems, and have a direct impact on a client account, we’d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

