&lt;h1&gt;Staffing Specialist&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Onsite | Full-Time | Branch Operations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Staffing Specialist, you&#39;ll play a key role in connecting great people with meaningful career opportunities while helping our clients build high-performing teams. This is more than a recruiting position—it&#39;s a dynamic role that combines recruiting, relationship management, customer service, and branch operations.&amp;nbsp;If you&#39;re resourceful, people-focused, and energized by making an impact every day, we&#39;d love to meet you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Staffing Specialist at Openwork, you&#39;ll serve as a trusted partner to both our talent and our clients by:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recruiting and placing top talent through sourcing, networking, referrals, job boards, and community outreach while managing the hiring process from sourcing through onboarding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building strong relationships with talent by providing coaching, regular communication, and ongoing support throughout their assignments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partnering with clients to understand their workforce needs, conduct routine check-ins, and deliver thoughtful staffing solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporting business growth by skill-marketing qualified candidates, collaborating with the sales team, and identifying opportunities to strengthen client partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintaining operational excellence by supporting payroll, timekeeping, compliance, and other branch operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for someone who is passionate about helping people, thrives in a fast-paced environment, and enjoys building lasting relationships. Ideal candidates will have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bilingual in Spanish &amp;amp; English required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1+ years of recruiting, staffing, customer service, sales, or other client-facing experience preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and relationship-building skills with the ability to connect with both clients and candidates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent organizational and time management skills, with the ability to manage multiple priorities simultaneously.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive, resourceful approach to problem-solving and a strong sense of ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to adapt quickly, work independently, and collaborate effectively as part of a team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with Microsoft Office and the ability to learn new systems and technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A valid driver&#39;s license and reliable transportation for client visits and community outreach, as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why Openwork?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more than 50 years, Openwork has been reimagining what staffing can be—bringing ease, accessibility, and thoughtfulness to every interaction. We&#39;re proud to be recognized as a &lt;strong&gt;ClearlyRated Best of Staffing®&lt;/strong&gt; winner, one of &lt;strong&gt;SIA&#39;s Fastest Growing Staffing Companies&lt;/strong&gt;, and a &lt;strong&gt;2025 Best Staffing Firms to Work For&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
