&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full-Time | Openwork Health&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Openwork Health, our recruiters are the driving force behind building relationships with healthcare professionals and creating a great candidate experience from first conversation through their first assignment. If you enjoy recruiting, building connections, and working in a fast-paced environment where no two days are the same, we&#39;d love to meet you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Recruit, interview, and hire healthcare professionals for local per diem and contract opportunities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Source candidates through job boards, social media, referrals, networking, and other recruiting channels&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Screen candidates to assess their qualifications, experience, and overall fit&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Guide new hires through the onboarding process, including employment paperwork, credential verification, and compliance requirements&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partner with our Credentialing team to ensure background checks, drug screens, and required documentation are completed prior to activation&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build and maintain a pipeline of qualified healthcare professionals for current and future hiring needs&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stay in regular contact with candidates throughout the hiring process to keep them engaged and informed&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work closely with the Staffing team to understand hiring priorities and upcoming staffing needs&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Prepare candidate submission packets for the Staffing team to present for contract opportunities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Conduct new hire orientation and ensure a smooth transition to the Staffing Specialist once onboarding is complete&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Maintain accurate candidate records and documentation in our systems&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Represent Openwork Health professionally and provide an exceptional candidate experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Recruiting or staffing experience in agency setting is preferred&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong communication and relationship-building skills&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ability to manage multiple priorities in a fast-paced environment&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Organized with strong attention to detail&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Self-motivated, resourceful, and able to work with a sense of urgency&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Positive attitude, coachable, and eager to learn&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why Openwork?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Openwork has been helping people find meaningful work for more than 50 years. We&#39;re proud to be a ClearlyRated Best of Staffing® winner and one of SIA&#39;s Fastest Growing Staffing Companies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Openwork Health, you&#39;ll join a collaborative team that values relationships, accountability, and doing the right thing. You&#39;ll have the opportunity to make an impact every day while growing your career in a supportive, people-first culture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ready to get started?&lt;/strong&gt; We&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;183&quot; data-end=&quot;201&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(30, 17, 80);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;183&quot; data-end=&quot;201&quot;&gt;About Openwork&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;203&quot; data-end=&quot;608&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(30, 17, 80);&quot;&gt;Openwork is a high-growth, people-first staffing company reimagining what modern hiring can be. Privately owned and proudly independent, we move fast, think big, and give every team member a real seat at the table. With over 50 years of experience, we’re combining industry expertise with a fresh, innovative approach — bringing ease, accessibility, and thoughtfulness to every step of the hiring journey.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;610&quot; data-end=&quot;851&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(30, 17, 80);&quot;&gt;We’ve been recognized as one of SIA’s Fastest Growing Staffing Companies and a ClearlyRated Best of Staffing® Client and Talent Award winner. As we continue to grow, every new hire plays a critical role in shaping our company and our future.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;853&quot; data-end=&quot;868&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(30, 17, 80);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;853&quot; data-end=&quot;868&quot;&gt;Why Join Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;870&quot; data-end=&quot;1218&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(30, 17, 80);&quot;&gt;Every internal role at Openwork is more than a job — it’s an opportunity to help build a progressive, modern staffing company from the inside out. We keep red tape to a minimum and encourage fresh ideas, bold thinking, and collaborative problem-solving. You&#39;ll be part of a close-knit, mission-driven team that values curiosity, trust, and results.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1220&quot; data-end=&quot;1237&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(30, 17, 80);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1220&quot; data-end=&quot;1237&quot;&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1239&quot; data-end=&quot;1508&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(30, 17, 80);&quot; data-start=&quot;1239&quot; data-end=&quot;1310&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1241&quot; data-end=&quot;1310&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(30, 17, 80);&quot;&gt;Competitive base salary with monthly commissions or bonus potential&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(30, 17, 80);&quot; data-start=&quot;1311&quot; data-end=&quot;1345&quot;&gt;
