&lt;h1&gt;Market Manager&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Onsite | Full-Time&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you a leader who thrives on growing a business, developing people, and delivering results?&amp;nbsp;At Openwork, our Market Managers lead both the sales and operations side of the business. They are responsible for growing their market, building high-performing teams, creating exceptional customer experiences, and owning the financial success of their branch.&amp;nbsp;If you&#39;re a hands-on leader who enjoys coaching teams, building client relationships, and driving business growth, we&#39;d love to meet you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Grow the market by developing new business, expanding existing client partnerships, and identifying new opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, coach, and develop a high-performing sales, recruiting, and operations team while fostering a culture of accountability and collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the market&#39;s P&amp;amp;L, using financial and operational data to drive performance, profitability, and long-term growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong relationships with clients by delivering exceptional service and creating staffing solutions that meet their business needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set clear goals, monitor key performance metrics, and help your team achieve individual and branch objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with leadership to execute strategic initiatives and continuously improve branch performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee branch operations, including recruiting, compliance, payroll approvals, risk management, and overall operational excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create an engaging, positive culture where employees are empowered to grow, succeed, and deliver outstanding results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience leading a sales, staffing, recruiting, or operations team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong business development and relationship-building skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing financial performance, budgets, or P&amp;amp;L responsibilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A servant leader who enjoys coaching, mentoring, and developing others.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong decision-making, problem-solving, and organizational skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to balance strategy with hands-on execution in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why Openwork?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Openwork is reimagining staffing by putting people first. For more than 50 years, we&#39;ve helped businesses build great teams while creating meaningful opportunities for job seekers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re proud to be recognized as a ClearlyRated Best of Staffing® winner, one of SIA&#39;s Fastest Growing Staffing Companies, and one of the 2025 Best Staffing Firms to Work For.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you&#39;re looking for an opportunity to lead a team, grow a business, and make a lasting impact in your community, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ready to lead your market? Apply today.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

